Step 1: Confirm with the thresholds removed

This is the same query with no threshold and an explicit 2-hour window:

timeseries {re = avg(dt.process.network.packets.re_tx_aggr),
            tx = avg(dt.process.network.packets.tx)},
           by:{dt.entity.process_group_instance}, from:-2h
| fieldsAdd reRate = coalesce(arrayAvg(re), 0),
            txRate = coalesce(arrayAvg(tx), 0)
| lookup [ fetch dt.entity.process_group_instance | fields id, tags ],
         sourceField: dt.entity.process_group_instance, lookupField: id, prefix: "e."
| expand tag = e.tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize processes = countDistinctExact(dt.entity.process_group_instance),
            reRate    = sum(reRate),
            txRate    = sum(txRate),
            by:{apmid}
| fieldsAdd retransPct = if(txRate > 0, 100.0 * reRate / txRate, else: 0.0)
| sort retransPct desc
| limit 10

Rows with the same values as Check B: the query is fine and the tile timeframe was the problem. Set the tile timeframe to Last 2 hours, or keep from:-2h in the query.
Values noticeably lower now: retransmissions have dropped since Check B, so an empty tile is the correct result at this moment.
Step 2: Tuned tile (more forgiving thresholds)

This lowers the limits to 0.5% and a 10 packets/s minimum, so the two apps from Check B (APP00002734 and APP00237082) appear when they're elevated. The 5% Critical limit stays the same. These are still my placeholders, not your policy.

timeseries {re = avg(dt.process.network.packets.re_tx_aggr),
            tx = avg(dt.process.network.packets.tx)},
           by:{dt.entity.process_group_instance}, from:-2h
| fieldsAdd reRate = coalesce(arrayAvg(re), 0),
            txRate = coalesce(arrayAvg(tx), 0)
| lookup [ fetch dt.entity.process_group_instance | fields id, tags ],
         sourceField: dt.entity.process_group_instance, lookupField: id, prefix: "e."
| expand tag = e.tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| summarize processes = countDistinctExact(dt.entity.process_group_instance),
            reRate    = sum(reRate),
            txRate    = sum(txRate),
            by:{apmid}
| fieldsAdd retransPct = if(txRate > 0, 100.0 * reRate / txRate, else: 0.0)
| filter retransPct >= 0.5 and txRate >= 10
| fieldsAdd status = if(retransPct >= 5, "🔴 Critical", else: "🟠 Warning"),
            rank   = if(retransPct >= 5, 1, else: 2)
| fields status, apmid, processes,
         retransPct = round(retransPct, decimals:2),
         retransPerSec = round(reRate, decimals:2),
         txPerSec = round(txRate, decimals:0), rank
| sort rank asc, retransPct desc
| fieldsRemove rank


